  <dialog id="about-dialog" aria-labelledby="about-title"><div class="dialog-top"><span class="eyebrow">SCOPE &amp; METHOD</span><button class="close-dialog" aria-label="Close scope and method">×</button></div><h2 id="about-title">What this briefing covers</h2><p>The atlas connects public research across agentic AI, security and social science. Contact cards identify their sources; solid lines mark documented relationships and dashed lines mark inferred connections. The paper catalogue retains the original Yue Zhang and collaborator literature collection.</p><p>Findings report the papers’ results. Anomalies identify measurement or provenance issues. Design proposals are our applications of the evidence, not experimentally validated systems.</p><p>Search and graphs run locally in the browser. No analytics, remote fonts, or automatic third-party requests are added. Primary sources open only when selected.</p><p>This local preview demonstrates the entry interaction. Server-side authentication and private hosting are not configured.</p></dialog>
